//// set: en-t1 — 类型维（枚举 / Boolean）数组：元素 / 整体引用、数组方程；for 方程在类型名 / 标签范围 / 标签数组上迭代
//// model: T10
model T10
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  y[E.one] = a; y[E.two] = 1; y[E.three] = 2;
end T10;
//// model: T11
model T11
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean];
equation
  y[false] = a; y[true] = 1;
end T11;
//// model: T12
model T12
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2};
end T12;
//// model: T13
model T13
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = y[E.two] + 1;
end T13;
//// model: T14
model T14
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean] = {a, 1}; Real z = y[true] + 1;
end T14;
//// model: T15
model T15
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[E] = y;
end T15;
//// model: T16
model T16
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[3] = y;
end T16;
//// model: T17
model T17
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = sum(y);
end T17;
//// model: T18
model T18
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[E] = 2 * y;
end T18;
//// model: T19
model T19
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[E];
equation
  z = y;
end T19;
//// model: T110
model T110
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  y = {a, 1, 2};
end T110;
//// model: T111
model T111
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  for i in E loop y[i] = a; end for;
end T111;
//// model: T112
model T112
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  for i in E.one:E.three loop y[i] = a; end for;
end T112;
//// model: T113
model T113
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  for i in E.two:E.three loop y[i] = a; end for; y[E.one] = 0;
end T113;
//// model: T114
model T114
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean];
equation
  for i in Boolean loop y[i] = a; end for;
end T114;
//// model: T115
model T115
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean];
equation
  for i in false:true loop y[i] = a; end for;
end T115;
//// model: T116
model T116
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  E x[E];
equation
  for i in E loop x[i] = i; end for;
end T116;
//// model: T117
model T117
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Integer n[E];
equation
  for i in E loop n[i] = Integer(i); end for;
end T117;
//// model: T118
model T118
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[3];
equation
  for i in E loop y[Integer(i)] = a; end for;
end T118;
//// model: T119
model T119
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  for i in E loop y[i] = if i == E.two then a else 0; end for;
end T119;
//// model: T120
model T120
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  for i in E loop y[i] = if i < E.three then a else 0; end for;
end T120;
//// model: T121
model T121
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Boolean b[Boolean];
equation
  for i in Boolean loop b[i] = not i; end for;
end T121;
//// model: T122
model T122
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  for i in {E.one, E.three} loop y[i] = a; end for; y[E.two] = 0;
end T122;
//// model: T123
model T123
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[2, E];
equation
  for i in 1:2, j in E loop y[i, j] = a * i; end for;
end T123;
//// model: T124
model T124
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E, 2];
equation
  for i in E, j in 1:2 loop y[i, j] = a * j; end for;
end T124;
//// model: T125
model T125
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = sum(y[i] for i in E);
end T125;
//// model: T126
model T126
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = max(y[i] for i in E);
end T126;
//// model: T127
model T127
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[3] = {y[i] for i in E};
end T127;
//// model: T128
model T128
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  String s[E];
equation
  for i in E loop s[i] = String(i); end for;
end T128;
//// model: T129
model T129
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  parameter Real p[E] = {1, 2, 3}; Real y = p[E.two] * a;
end T129;
//// model: T130
model T130
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  constant Real c[E] = {1, 2, 3}; Real y = c[E.two] * a;
end T130;
